{
  "comment": [
    "Technofluid (Lube Chem Industries) GST tax invoice, laid out like Gaurav's current invoices (June 2026 samples).",
    "Every value arrives formatted from the office app (office/core/src/invoice-bill.ts): money in Indian grouping, dates DD-MM-YYYY,",
    "the tax lines and round-off already labelled. The template only places them. Field list: office/hbe/DATA-CONTRACT.md.",
    "The note row under the IRN is always there (blank when the sale has no note). The header (seller, invoice details, billed/shipped to, IRN) and the footer (bank, terms, QR, signature) repeat on every page,",
    "as on the paper invoices. The items table fills the page, so the totals sit at the bottom of the last page."
  ],
  "page": {
    "widthPt": 595.276, "heightPt": 841.89,
    "marginLeftPt": 28.0, "marginRightPt": 28.0,
    "marginTopPt": 24.0, "marginBottomPt": 24.0
  },
  "defaults": { "font": "regular", "sizePt": 8.0, "lineHeightPt": 10.5 },
  "flags": ["isInterState", "hasIrn", "hasNotes", "hasBank"],
  "rowStyles": {
    "item": { "ruleBelow": false }
  },
  "pageHeader": [
    {
      "type": "columns",
      "divider": false,
      "columns": [
        { "width": "*", "bands": [
          { "type": "partyBlock", "paddingPt": 0, "alignLabels": false, "lines": [
            { "label": "GSTIN : ", "value": { "field": "seller.gstin", "required": true }, "style": { "font": "bold", "sizePt": 8.5 } }
          ]}
        ]},
        { "width": 160.0, "bands": [
          { "type": "textBand", "paddingPt": 0, "lines": [
            { "segments": [ { "value": { "field": "copyLabel" }, "align": "right", "style": { "font": "italic", "sizePt": 8.5 } } ] }
          ]}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "textBand",
      "paddingPt": 0,
      "gapAbovePt": 1.0,
